{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o124a","title":"孙壹举众归魏拜车骑将军交州牧","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o124a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"孙壹举众归魏拜车骑将军交州牧","evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q"]},{"id":"shaodi-a-p034-judgment","label":"裴松之论","text":"裴松之认为孙壹因逼归命不应授礼过厚，并以孟达黄权孙秀孙楷比较。","evidence":["shaodi-q-p034-judgment"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-e894a45d65e2931de217","label":"正文","text":"綝遣朱异潜袭壹；异至武昌，壹知其攻己，率部曲千余口，过将胤妻奔魏","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-82feaf1f5684007ab5d1","label":"正文","text":"魏以壹为车骑将军、仪同三司，封吴侯；以故主芳贵人邢氏妻之","evidence":["zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0112","role":"归降受任","evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q"]},{"person":"houzhu-p0013","role":"遣袭者","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0126","role":"受遣潜袭者","evidence":["zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0049","role":"嫁壹者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":257,"label":"六月乙巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y257","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o117","basis":"六月乙巳"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o124a-q","shaodi-q-o117","shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o124a-q","source_order":[4,530,"O124a"],"order":1189},{"id":"shaodi-e-o138b","title":"孙壹为婢所杀","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o138b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"孙壹为婢所杀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o138b-q"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-9e88fbf13cd2d218327b","label":"正文","text":"邢美色妒忌，下不堪命，遂共杀壹及邢氏","evidence":["zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-61162003a672c5ed7c53","label":"正文","text":"壹入魏（黄初）三年死","evidence":["zongshi-q-8d889d5c3d2faae89e40"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0112","role":"被杀","evidence":["shaodi-e-o138b-q"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0049","role":"被杀者","evidence":["zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":259,"label":"十一月癸卯","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y259","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o135","basis":"十一月癸卯"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o138b-q","shaodi-q-o135","shaodi-q-b-c919b0b274bfdccf1c17"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o138b-q","source_order":[4,630,"O138b"],"order":1218}],"persons":[{"id":"zongshi-p0049","name":"邢氏","evidence":["zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383","zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o124a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-724e4d584ead501e0188","layer":"original","quote":"六月，乙巳〖21〗，诏：“吴使持节、都督夏口诸军事、镇军将军、沙羡侯孙壹〖22〗，贼之支属，位为上将；畏天知命，深鉴祸福；翻然举众，远归大国。虽微子去殷〖23〗，乐毅遁燕〖24〗，无以加之。其以壹为侍中、车骑将军，假节，交州牧，吴侯；开府辟召仪同三司〖25〗；依古侯伯八命之礼〖26〗，衮冕、赤舄：事从丰厚。”﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":529,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":158},{"id":"shaodi-e-o138b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-90d081a32f3abfc181f4","layer":"original","quote":"冬十月，丙寅〖3〗，分新城郡，复置上庸郡。十一月，癸卯〖4〗，车骑将军孙壹为婢所杀。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":37,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-6209c552405e0ebbdf98","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：甘露二年（公元 257 ）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":535,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-4dd98e402a6a8de51491","start":0,"end":20},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-c919b0b274bfdccf1c17","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-c919b0b274bfdccf1c17","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：甘露四年（公元 259）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-20f59c750826a5b508ea","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"shaodi-q-o117","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d021e0b00f489a01f208","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月〖1〗，青龙现温县井中。三月，司空卢毓薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":522,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":26},{"id":"shaodi-q-o135","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-72c9f9276a8abbc231e6","layer":"original","quote":"四年春正月〖1〗，黄龙二，现宁陵县界井中。﹝一﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_001.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"shaodi-q-p034-judgment","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-35d064e11b05dfeb4b27","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞臣松之以为：壹畏逼归命，事无可嘉。格以古义，欲盖而名彰者也。当时之宜，未得远遵式典；固应量才受赏，足以酬其来情而已。至乃光锡八命，礼同台鼎，不亦过乎！于招携致远，又无取焉。何者？若使彼之将守，与时无嫌，终不悦于殊宠，坐生叛心；以叛而愧，辱孰甚焉？如其忧危将及，非奔不免，则必逃死苟存，无希荣利矣：然则高位厚禄，何为者哉？魏初有孟达、黄权，在晋有孙秀、孙楷。达、权爵赏，比壹为轻；秀、楷礼秩，优异尤甚。及至吴平，而降黜数等；不承权舆，岂不缘在始失中乎？","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":574,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-ad4fae97affa47236d4e","start":0,"end":228},{"id":"zongshi-q-495c745c24e943347c58","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-4d4c1542c098dab2b8c8","layer":"original","quote":"綝遣朱异潜袭壹。异至武昌，壹知其攻己；率部曲千余口，过将胤妻奔魏","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":72,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":83,"end":115},{"id":"zongshi-q-87b9127c6919627b45b5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-6241288b0cc62fe8d83a","layer":"original","quote":"邢美色妒忌；下不堪命〖15〗，遂共杀壹及邢氏","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":60},{"id":"zongshi-q-8d889d5c3d2faae89e40","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-6241288b0cc62fe8d83a","layer":"original","quote":"壹入魏（黄初）三年死","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":61,"end":71},{"id":"zongshi-q-c8c913b61216af99a383","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-6241288b0cc62fe8d83a","layer":"original","quote":"魏以壹为车骑将军，仪同三司〖13〗，封吴侯；以故主芳贵人邢氏，妻之","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":73,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":33}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
